// src/v4/extdeps/languages/rust.dag
// Scope: Rust Reference LanguageModel — scalar fact-bundles, inhabitants, bidirectional grammar data.
// Owns: RustScalar, RustIntegerPrimitiveFacts, RustFloatPrimitiveFacts, RustNonIntegerPrimitiveFacts, RustLanguageModel, rust_*_facts, rust_*_inhabitant_node, rust_declared_inhabitants_root, rust_mvp1_target_model, rust_wave1_* grammar/lex.
// Consumes: v4.compiler.parse, v4.compiler.tokenize, v4.std.collection, v4.std.node, v4.std.logic, v4.std.algebra, v4.std.cardinality, v4.std.text.
// Status: T-4 rust slice — Rust Reference primitives (not std::string::String); `core: ModelCore` (#3474) primitives + surface-symbol membership from `rust_*_facts_catalog` via fold; canonical_symbols = catalog surface spellings + wave-1 lex/grammar/MVP; target_model edge keys from std/target_model.dag; MVP-1 grammar/token substrate for T-10 (literal Node round-trip still 🟡); bool/`!` canonical-B decl-ref — 🟡 E-6(b) staging.
// Anchor: https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/types.html

